{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05931","headline":"故人张諲工诗善易卜兼能丹青草隶顷以诗见赠聊获酬之 · 王维","name":"故人张諲工诗善易卜兼能丹青草隶顷以诗见赠聊获酬之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不逐城东游侠儿，隐囊纱帽坐弹棋。\n蜀中夫子时开卦，洛下书生解咏诗。\n药阑花迳衡门里，时复据梧聊隐几。\n屏风误点惑孙郎，团扇草书轻内史。\n故园高枕度三春，永日垂帷绝四邻。\n自想蔡邕今已老，更将书籍使何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}